我就想让你回到一个美好的家嘛
so I wanted you to come home to something nice.

10
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:45,050
你真是太贴心了
Oh, that is so thoughtful.

11
00:00:45,550 --> 00:00:48,010
你还记得我们去圣巴巴拉市品酒
Hey, do you remember when we went wine tasting in Santa Barbara

12
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:49,890
你说这是你喝过最好喝的玫瑰红吗
and you said that was the best rose you'd ever had?

13
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:55,100
我就记得我们开车去那边  进了酿酒厂  然后...就断片了
Yeah, I remember us driving up there,going to the winery and...that's it.

14
00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:58,770
这酒就是你断片的原因啊
And this wine is why.

15
