有你真幸运
I am so lucky to have you.

19
00:01:13,660 --> 00:01:15,160
小心  这个很烫
Well, now be careful, these are hot.

20
00:01:15,330 --> 00:01:19,290
虽然我能解释这个的热力学  就是为什么起司看起来比披萨边烫
I-I could explain the thermodynamics of why the cheese seems hotter than the crust,

21
00:01:19,460 --> 00:01:21,130
但我决定把解释留在自己心里
but instead, I'm gonna keep it to myself.

22
00:01:21,420 --> 00:01:24,550
你总是知道什么不该说
You always know what not to say.

23
00:01:26,050 --> 00:01:27,630
我只是不敢相信你布置了这一切
I just, I can't believe you did all this.

24
00:01:28,090 --> 00:01:31,510
是这样的  相处久了很容易不拿对方当一回事
Well, you know,it's easy to take each other for granted

25
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:34,510
我永远不想这样对你  因为...
and I never want to do that to you, because

26
00:01:35,720 --> 00:01:38,770
你的爱  就像一条河
your love, it's like a river.

27
00:01:39,480 --> 00:01:41,650
平静又深邃
It's peaceful and deep.

28
00:01:42,610 --> 00:01:46,650
你的灵魂  就像个秘密 我永远也守不住
Your soul is, it's like a secret that I never could keep.

29
00:01:48,820 --> 00:01:50,780
你居然还引用了超级男孩的歌词
You did not just quote an NSYNC song.

30
00:01:52,950 --> 00:01:54,530
引用自你最爱的超级男孩歌曲
I quoted your favorite NSYNC song.

31
00:02:07,340 --> 00:02:10,180
靠  我打太大一个嗝  我在游戏里都死了
Damn. I burped so hard,I died in my game.

32
